{"id":"n72169-1-7","stage":3,"title":"코피 · 鼻血","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72169-1-7-1","ko":"대체 누구랑 싸웠기에 얼굴이 피투성이야?","zh":"你到底和谁打架了，脸怎么全是血的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟。","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}},{"text":"누구랑","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구랑","audio":"/audio/212e592f63fdd98c9479.mp3"}},{"text":"싸웠기에","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；기에：说明作为判断或行动根据的原因：“因为、鉴于”。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸웠기에","audio":"/audio/fd23bebea5ecf414d59b.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"피투성이야?","meaning":"浑身是血，血肉模糊","explanation":"피투성이：浑身是血，血肉模糊；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"피투성이","audio":"/audio/5eb20c372e7780aec380.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85540","senseId":"1","lemma":"피투성이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피투성이야","audio":"/audio/f42d136640a7cebdf737.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"baa66ff689021a3f","term":"대체","zh":"到底、究竟","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3","definition":"用于疑问句，